: none. Glass: smug."], "dance_medal_shout_encore_up_at_the_ribbon": ["Encore. ENCORE. They never do one.", "Demanded another. Medal stayed put. Diva."], "dance_medal_tie_his_feet_in_a_knot_mid_step": ["Knotted. Left foot did it. I'm not talking to it.", "Untied myself. A little encore of dignity."], "dance_medal_hook_a_toe_on_the_end_stud_mid_leap": ["Stud 1, toe 0. The stud has been there longer.", "Hopped it off. It was a planned limp."], "dance_medal_waltz_along_the_base_with_a_friend": ["Waltzed with a friend. Nobody led. Everybody fell over.", "Slow dance. Faster feelings."], "dance_medal_judge_each_others_spins_out_of_ten": ["Eight. For effort. Minus two for the smirk.", "I gave myself a ten. Friend gave me a look."]},
